  "bodyHash": "ca8b271acc404b04",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。用心打造。大量活跃支持的 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Tree Harvester 是一款可配置的模组，允许玩家通过砍伐任意一个基础方块瞬间收割树木、诡异木树以及巨型蘑菇。该基础方块可以是树干的任何部分。收割后，树苗会自动使用掉落物进行替换。模组内置了多项检查机制，从防止误砍由原木建造的房屋，到控制树叶的腐烂范围。<br><br>默认情况下，收割功能仅在按住蹲下键时生效，但此设置可在配置文件中更改。更多功能示例请参阅下方。模组提供了丰富的配置选项，供您根据个人喜好进行调整。<br><br>本模组旨在与我的 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ore-harvester\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ore Harvester</a> 模组配合使用。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>默认配置下的功能特性：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>所有树木（原版及模组添加）均可通过蹲下并砍伐任意一个方块快速收割。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>砍伐树木所需的时间取决于树干中的原木数量。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>收割树木后，树叶会迅速腐烂消失。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>当最后一块树叶腐烂后，树苗会自动重新生成。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>下界中的诡异木树可以快速收割。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>巨型蘑菇也可以快速收割<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>可通过黑名单功能豁免特定类型的斧头参与树木收割。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>包含多项检测机制以准确识别树木，防止误毁房屋。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>当两种不同类型的树木相邻时，仅被砍伐树木的树叶会腐烂。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>兼容其他模组。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"依赖 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收录于 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收录于 Serilum 的 QoL 整合包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"环境：服务器端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mustHoldAxeForTreeHarvest</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，仅当玩家在主手持有斧头时才能进行树木收割。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>treeHarvestWithoutSneak</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，不按住蹲下键即可进行树木收割。禁用则相反，仅在按住蹲下键时生效。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>automaticallyFindBottomBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">模组是否尝试寻找树木最底部的原木并开始砍伐。这意味着即使你从树干中间开始破坏，整棵树仍会被完全砍倒。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableFastLeafDecay</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，被砍伐树木周围的树叶会迅速消失。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableNetherTrees</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，下界中的诡异菌柄/绯红菌柄树木也将被快速砍伐。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableHugeMushrooms</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，巨型蘑菇也将被快速砍伐。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>ignorePlayerMadeTrees</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，树叶由玩家放置的树木将不会被销毁。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>replaceSaplingOnTreeHarvest</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，收割树木时会自动使用掉落物替换树苗。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>replaceMushroomOnMushroomHarvest</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，在开启 'enableHugeMushrooms' 的前提下，收割巨型蘑菇时会自动使用掉落物替换蘑菇。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>loseDurabilityPerHarvestedLog</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，每收割一根原木，手持的斧头都会消耗耐久。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>loseDurabilityModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 1.0，最小值 0.001，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">在此可设置砍伐一棵树时斧头应消耗的耐久比例。例如设为 0.1，则表示每砍伐 10 根原木消耗 1 点耐久。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseExhaustionPerHarvestedLog</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，玩家每收割一根原木的饥饿值（疲劳度）增加量为 0.005（Minecraft 原版默认每个破坏方块） * increaseExhaustionModifier。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseExhaustionModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 1.0，最小值 0.001，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">此选项决定玩家每收割一根原木所增加的疲劳度数值。默认为 0.005 * 1.0。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseHarvestingTimePerLog</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，收割时间将随树干中现存原木的数量增加而延长。增加幅度由 'increasedHarvestingTimePerLogModifier' 决定。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increasedHarvestingTimePerLogModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 0.1，最小值 0.01，最大值 10.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用 'increaseHarvestingTimePerLog' 后，收割单棵树木额外延长的时间系数。实际速度计算公式为：newSpeed = originalSpeed / (1 + (logCount * increasedHarvestingTimePerLogModifier))。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>amountOfLeavesBrokenPerTick</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 3，最小值 1，最大值 16</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">树木收割后，每游戏刻（tick）应腐烂的树叶数量。调高此值可加快树叶腐烂速度，但会增加每刻的计算开销。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>斧头黑名单功能：</strong></span><br>您可以仅允许特定类型的斧头进行树木收割。模组首次加载时会生成一个黑名单文件，位于 <strong><em>./config/treeharvester/harvestable_axe_blacklist.txt</em></strong>。此功能同样适用于模组添加的斧头物品。<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/blacklist.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"效果展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>收割紧邻橡树的白桦树。仅白桦树叶正在腐烂：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/birch_only.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>一棵大型橡树：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/big_oak_only.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>一棵 2x2 云杉树。砍伐时间较长，且全部 4 株树苗均正确替换：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/big_spruce.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>支持诡异木（下界）树木：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/nether_tree.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>同样适用于巨型蘑菇，这是一株棕色蘑菇：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/brown_mushroom.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>以及一株红色蘑菇：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/red_mushroom.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"注意事项与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下载源保持在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态内，您可自由将该模组用于任何整合包。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由于我无法在多个独立的模组页面中统一追踪评论，评论区已关闭。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如需反馈问题、提供想法、建议或任何其他交流，请访问&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
